[00:58.23] When I was young, I traveled to distant lands
[01:05.22] A castle arises from a sea of sand
[01:12.25] Its towers shimmer in the heat of the sun
[01:20.28] Shining down shadow for everyone
[02:21.30] Swinging on swings that hang from great trees
[02:29.38] Lulled to sleep by the breath of the breeze
[02:36.38] My forgotten thoughts drop down to the sea
[02:43.35] So I lived a life which was my dream
[03:34.34] Can't find a key to the sleepy silver door
[03:40.49] I'm washed up on the shore of reality
[05:26.64] 